    {
      "id": "open-projects",
      "title": "The Projects board",
      "narration": "Once a bid is won, it becomes a project, and this is where the real work gets managed. Every job you're running shows up here, organized by stage so you can see your whole operation at a glance. Let's open one up and walk through it.",
      "caption": { "text": "The Projects board", "position": "bottom" },
      "minDurationMs": 13000,
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "${BWP_DEMO_URL}/projects" },
        { "type": "waitFor", "selector": "button:has-text('New Project'), main", "timeoutMs": 15000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1000 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "main button[class*='cursor-pointer']", "comment": "hover a project card" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open-project",
      "title": "The project command center",
      "narration": "This is the project command center. Right up top you've got the essentials, the contract value, your overall progress, and the current status front and center, so you know at a glance whether the job is on track. No digging, no guessing, it's all right here.",
      "caption": { "text": "The project command center", "position": "bottom" },
      "minDurationMs": 15000,
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "${BWP_DEMO_URL}/projects/${CAPTURE_PROJECT_ID}" },
        { "type": "waitFor", "selector": "[role='tab']:has-text('Overview')", "timeoutMs": 15000 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "text=/In Progress/i", "comment": "status badge in the header" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 900 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "text=/Contract/i" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 900 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "text=/Progress/i" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "schedule",
      "title": "Phases & tasks",
      "narration": "Let's talk scheduling. Under Phases and Tasks I can break the job into phases, like demo, rough-in, and finish, and then add the tasks that live under each one. I'll add a new phase right now. Everything you set up here feeds directly into the timeline.",
      "caption": { "text": "1. Schedule phases & tasks", "position": "bottom" },
      "minDurationMs": 17000,
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "${BWP_DEMO_URL}/projects/${CAPTURE_PROJECT_ID}" },
        { "type": "waitFor", "selector": "[role='tab']:has-text('Phases')", "timeoutMs": 15000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[role='tab']:has-text('Phases')" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1300 },
        { "type": "type", "selector": "input[placeholder='Add new phase...']", "text": "Rough-In", "delayMs": 70 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 600 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "button:has-text('Add Phase')" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1800 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "input[placeholder='Add task...']", "comment": "tasks nest under a phase" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gantt",
      "title": "The Gantt timeline",
      "narration": "And with one click, that same task list becomes a full Gantt chart. Now I can see how the whole job sequences out, what overlaps, where the critical path runs, and whether we're going to hit our completion date. Adjust the schedule here, and your whole team stays on the same page.",
      "caption": { "text": "2. See it on the Gantt timeline", "position": "bottom" },
      "minDurationMs": 15000,
      "actions": [
        { "type": "navigate", "url": "${BWP_DEMO_URL}/projects/${CAPTURE_PROJECT_ID}" },
        { "type": "waitFor", "selector": "[role='tab']:has-text('Phases')", "timeoutMs": 15000 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "[role='tab']:has-text('Phases')" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "click", "selector": "main button:has-text('Gantt')" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1800 },
        { "type": "hover", "selector": "main svg, main canvas, [class*='gantt' i]" },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
        { "type": "scroll", "y": 280 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
        { "type": "scroll", "y": 0 },
        { "type": "wait", "ms": 800 }
      ]
